            "3(x + 5) = 3x + 15"
          ],
          "regle": "**Développer**, c’est distribuer&nbsp;; **factoriser**, c’est repérer le ==facteur commun==.",
          "note": "5x + 15 = 5(x + 3)&nbsp;!"
        },
        {
          "type": "tableau",
          "numero": 2,
          "titre": "Les conventions",
          "entetes": [
            "On écrit",
            "Et non"
          ],
          "lignes": [
            [
              "3x",
              "3 × x"
            ],
            [
              "5(x + 2)",
              "5 × (x + 2)"
